  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "愛依！　優勝本当に──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6019001090010,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "──そうそう……っと、ゴメン！　ちょっと切るね～\r\nまた後で、はいはーい！",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "019",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/601900109/6019001090010"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0106",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、さっきから連絡が止まらないな",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6019001090020,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "みんな見に来てくれたみたいでさー\r\nちょー祝ってくれんの！　ヤバい嬉しいんだけど！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601900109/6019001090020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "よかったな……俺も嬉しいぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6019001090030,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "あ、でもさ～、『普段と全然違うじゃん』って\r\nめっちゃ言われた！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601900109/6019001090030"
  },
  {
    "id": 6019001090040,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "友達が『カッコいいから今度やってよ～』とか\r\n言ってくんの！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601900109/6019001090040"
  },
  {
    "id": 6019001090050,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "ほんと、プロデューサーとの作戦、大成功ってカンジ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601900109/6019001090050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "愛依の努力があったからこそ、成功したんだぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6019001090060,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "うん、サンキュ！\r\n……でもさ、有名になるって、こんなカンジなんだね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601900109/6019001090060"
  },
  {
    "id": 6019001090070,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "うち、ゲーノー人ってなんかすごそうとか思って\r\nかるーい気持ちで始めたけどさ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601900109/6019001090070"
  },
  {
    "id": 6019001090080,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "なんか、ヤバいことになってるよね、今\r\n毎日、ちょー楽し～よ！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601900109/6019001090080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "毎日楽しいか……\r\nそれが聞けてよかったよ、愛依",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、それにしてももう立派な芸能人じゃないか\r\nやったな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6019001090090,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "あ、それいっこ訂正！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601900109/6019001090090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bgm": "off"
  },
  {
    "id": 6019001090100,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "うちが今なりたいのは『ゲーノー人』じゃなくて……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601900109/6019001090100"
  },
  {
    "id": 6019001090110,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "『アイドル』だから！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "000",
    "voice": "produce_events/601900109/6019001090110"
  },
  {
    "id": 6019001090120,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "それも、今日みたいにみんながすげーって言ってくれる、\r\nちょーすごいアイドル！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601900109/6019001090120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "愛依……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6019001090130,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "あ、あとあと、うちひとりじゃなくて……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601900109/6019001090130"
  },
  {
    "id": 6019001090140,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "プロデューサーと一緒に頑張りたいってカンジ！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601900109/6019001090140"
  },
  {
    "id": 6019001090150,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "そんでいつかはさ、もっと上手く話せるようになって……\r\nほんとの自分で勝負できるようになりたいかも！",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601900109/6019001090150"
  },
  {
    "id": 6019001090160,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "だから、これからもヨロシク、プロデューサー！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601900109/6019001090160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、これからもよろしく頼む、愛依\r\nその夢、絶対に掴もうな！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6019001090170,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "うん、うちらふたりなら絶対にやれるっしょ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601900109/6019001090170"
  },
  {
    "label": "end",
